Unless a file states otherwise, data files under `data/processed/` are licensed
under CC BY 4.0. Source-rich data restored from the Zenodo archive is also
licensed under CC BY 4.0. Source code, examples, notebooks, and repository
documentation are licensed under MIT.

Users should cite OdorNet when using the dataset and should also cite original
data sources when downstream work depends on source-specific records,
historical labels, or raw-source interpretations.
